-- 段階E4 初期問題投入（自動生成 / gen_questions.py）
-- 全単元 計104問。qid で冪等 upsert（再実行で最新に更新）。
-- 前提：phaseE4_elearning.sql 実行済み（quiz_questions が存在・書込は admin のみ）。
-- 使い方：Supabase SQL Editor に貼り付け→Run（admin で実行）。または アプリの一括インポート(CSV)。

on conflict (qid) do update set
  unit = excluded.unit, sub = excluded.sub, difficulty = excluded.difficulty,
  question = excluded.question, choice_a = excluded.choice_a, choice_b = excluded.choice_b,
  choice_c = excluded.choice_c, choice_d = excluded.choice_d, correct = excluded.correct,
  explanation = excluded.explanation, source = excluded.source, updated_at = now();
